<p>Allows you to use melee weapons to focus your spells, granting a <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">40%, 51%, 59%, 65%, 70%</acronym> chance per melee attack to cast an offensive spell as a free action on the target.</p><p>Delivering the spell this way will not trigger a spell cooldown.</p><p>You may select an allowed spell to trigger this way, or choose to have one randomly selected for each attack.</p><p>While dual wielding or using a shield the chance is halved.</p><p>The chance increases with your Cunning.</p><p></p><p>Allowed spells: Flame, Lightning, Earthen Missiles </p>